5. Software included in the container image
================================================================================

The published image (nullpo7z/vantyx) is built on Alpine Linux and includes the
following packages. Vantyx invokes them as separate processes (fork/exec) and
does not link against them, so their copyleft terms do not extend to Vantyx's
own code.

- freerdp ................................ Apache-2.0
- xvfb (xorg-server) ..................... MIT
- x11vnc ................................. GPL-2.0-or-later
- tigervnc-client ........................ GPL-2.0-or-later
- ffmpeg ................................. GPL-2.0-or-later AND LGPL-2.1-or-later
- busybox / Alpine base .................. GPL-2.0-only and others
- asciinema agg .......................... Apache-2.0
- font-dejavu ............................ Bitstream Vera / Public Domain

These are unmodified Alpine packages. The corresponding sources are published
by Alpine Linux at https://gitlab.alpinelinux.org/alpine/aports and can be
retrieved for the exact versions in the image with:

    docker run --rm nullpo7z/vantyx:latest apk list -I

Anyone redistributing the image is responsible for passing on these terms.
